  "query_preview": "/MONDAY THROUGH FRIDAY/...\nIssued at 211 PM CST Fri Nov 6 2026\n\nThe extended forecast will be dominated by a persistent surface high \npressure system building into the region which will promote dry \nweather and a gradual warming trend. Daytime highs are forecast to \nmoderate into the low to mid-60s by the middle of next week, with \nnocturnal radiational cooling allowing overnight lows to fall into \nthe upper-30s to low-40s. While a series of weak mid-level \ndisturbances may periodically increase cloud cover, boundary-layer \nmoisture will remain limited, keeping the area dry through the \nperiod.",
